This certificate is the PUBLIC certificate for the K3s cluster hosted by
Merrick Campbell in his house. This is mainly serving as a placeholder
and should be replaced in future by MMS's actual K3s cluster certificate.

It is useful to store this here because developers can reference it when
setting up their kubectl locally on their devices. This is a public certificate
so there are no concerns about adding it to git

